    "Name": "Wulfen",
    "Details": "The D loadout utilizes an LB 2-X AC in the left arm, while the right arm is home to an Artemis V FCS-guided SRM-2 launcher. Both arms have CASE II protecting the 'Mech's one ton ammunition allotments.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
